# The VR session is about to be lost (#146): the headset or the runtime gone (loss pending). The game destroys the
# session, goes on in flat mode and names the cause in arx.log; the run then quits through the channel and must
# end cleanly - the exit hook reports nothing.
@sim idle
@args --loadlevel 10

@until state eq GAMEPLAY 60s
@until vr.sessionState eq focused 30s

vr-sim session loss-pending
@log OpenXR session ended by the runtime \(loss pending\), continuing in flat mode 10s
@until vr.sessionState eq none 10s
@frames 10
@assert state eq GAMEPLAY
@nolog ExitTrace
